    "paragraphs": [
      "Gone are the days of squeezing your feet into narrow,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trestrictive shoes just to get through your daily workout or commute. Whether you are\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tat the gym, hiking a trail, or navigating slippery city streets, Grounded Footwear\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmakes your journey—and your posture—much more natural. Available in versatile\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstyles, Grounded Footwear features a specialized non-slip sole that mimics the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfoot's natural shape. These barefoot shoes provide exceptional ground feel and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstability depending on the terrain or your specific activity. As a bonus, the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tflexible construction of Grounded Footwear helps strengthen your feet while you move\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthroughout your busy day.",
      "Since barefoot shoes have become so popular recently, many\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlow-quality imitations have flooded\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe market.",
      "We decided to test 20+ leading barefoot shoe brandsto see which\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGrounded Footwear\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tactually work as advertised. And we set our standards extremely high –",
      "The winner is Grounded Footwear, a focused\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbrand that, thanks to their innovative\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tnon-slip technology, found a way to balance protection and feel.",
      "4,215 Reviews",
