      "4,215 Reviews",
      "4,215 Reviews",
      "Grounded Footwear\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNon-Slip Barefoot Shoesboast a scientifically\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tengineered design to give you a stable, grounded feeling even on the slickest\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsurfaces. There is a huge variety of minimalist shoes available today, so it’s safe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tto say I found Grounded Footwear through careful research. And now, I can’t help\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbut recommend Grounded Footwear for doing much more than just providing a thin sole.",
      "You must be wondering, what makes Grounded Footwear so\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tspecial? How did Grounded Footwear beat the competition? Well, take a look at some\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\texceptional features Grounded Footwear has:",
      "Part of the Grounded Footwear’\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tappealand appeal has to be the incredible\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttraction it offers. It grips instantly on wet surfaces. That’s right. Instantly.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThat right there is a game changer. Grounded Footwear will keep you stable on the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmost\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdemanding terrain and do it with zero bulk or discomfort and zero hassle.",
      "The advanced non-slip outer sole comes with a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmulti-directional tread pattern, providing three levels of surface interaction. Here\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tare the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tgrip zones:",
      "No more settling for narrow fits; theGrounded Footwear\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBarefoot Shoesare available in multiple different\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsizes. A well-fitted Grounded Footwear shoe will improve your balance and help\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tyou get the most out of its barefoot functions.",
      "If you’re not sure about the size you should pick,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tyou can connect with the Grounded Footwear customer service team. They’re available\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t24*7 and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tgenerally respond fairly quickly.",
      "Grounded Footwear comes equipped with specialized\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsensory-feedback\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tzones across the sole. These zones transmit ground texture and are well\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdistributed to provide total control.",
      "Grounded Footwear is a brand that understands that\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tevery foot is unique. Some would prefer more ground feel while some would like extra\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tprotection. This is why Grounded Footwear designed a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tshoe that adapts to your gait and supports your natural foot mechanics\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taccording to your needs and preferences.",
      "Thanks to Grounded Footwear, you don’t have to sacrifice style\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand fashion to regulate your foot health. Grounded Footwear is\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbeautifully designed and pairs well with gym gear or casual outfits. You can wear\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGrounded Footwear easily without worrying about looking out of place.",
      "TheGrounded Footwear\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBarefoot Shoesare also machine-washable. How\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmany performance shoes can stay this fresh? Very few brands would\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tallow Grounded Footwear levels of durability without messing up its service life.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYou can also wash\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGrounded Footwear by hand. Just make sure to air dry.",
      "They offer long-lasting material durability, significantly\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbetter than other minimalist shoes available on the market today. This is one of the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmost\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\timportant features for Grounded Footwear. After all, you\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdon’t want to be on the trail with a shoe that wears down after a few miles.",
      "If these performance features didn’t seal the deal for you,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tnext policy surely will.",
      "Nobody wants to be duped by a sponsored or\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tquestionable review. You don’t want to end up with a product that you can’t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treturn and that doesn’t do anything for your movement.",
      "Grounded Footwear offers a 30-Day 100% money-back guarantee\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand no-hassle returns. If you don’t like the product, they’ll refund you your\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmoney. You get to have a safety net, and they get to prove Grounded Footwear has the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmettle to live up to your expectations. It’s a win-win!",
      "You can purchase Grounded Footwear fromthe official\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twebsite.They’re\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcurrently offering a 50% discount and free shipping. Grounded Footwear is\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpractically a steal at\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthat price point!",
      "Grounded Footwear can keep your feet healthy and strong every\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsingle day. If you have a job that mostly keeps you on your feet or if you are the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tadventurous type who likes to go hiking and training, you may want to check\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tout Grounded Footwear.",
      "Grounded Footwear is affordable, effective, durable, and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstylish — just the perfect combination for your outdoor activities and natural foot\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thealth.",
      "4,215 Reviews",
      "4,215 Reviews",
      "Affiliate Disclosure:",
      "The information on this site regarding Grounded Footwear is\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tnot intended or implied to be a substitute for\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tprofessional medical advice, diagnosis or treatment. All content, including text,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tgraphics, images and information, regarding Grounded Footwear is\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor general information purposes only. This site makes no representation and assumes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tno responsibility for the accuracy of information regarding Grounded Footwear, and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsuch information is subject to change without notice. You are\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tencouraged to confirm any information about Grounded Footwear with\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tother sources, and review all foot health conditions with your physician.",
